   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 4,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Run it four times",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## One piece per run\n\nSet **Piece** to 1 and queue with a **batch count of 4**: four runs, pieces 1-4 (Piece counts up after each run).\n\nEach piece is 57 frames, a new one every 48 frames; the last one ends on the last frame:\n\n| piece | frames | start |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 0-56 | 0 s |\n| 2 | 48-104 | 2.0 s |\n| 3 | 96-152 | 4.0 s |\n| 4 | 135-191 | 5.625 s |\n\nSaved lossless (crf 0) in output/video. Then the join workflow, `seedvr2_4k_join_pieces.json`.\n\nEvery model link and folder: `LINKS.md`."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## One piece per run\n\nSet **Piece** to 1 and queue with a **batch count of 4**: four runs, pieces 1-4 (Piece counts up after each run).\n\nEach piece is 57 frames, a new one every 48 frames; the last one ends on the last frame:\n\n| piece | frames | start |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 0-56 | 0 s |\n| 2 | 48-104 | 2.0 s |\n| 3 | 96-152 | 4.0 s |\n| 4 | 135-191 | 5.625 s |\n\nSaved lossless (crf 0) in output/video. Then the join workflow, `seedvr2_4k_join_pieces.json`.\n\nEvery model link and folder: `LINKS.md`."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
